WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.300
- You know, the things
you're talking about

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.250
are all kind of playing out--

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.770
- Technology is a son of a bitch.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.920
Technology doesn't care

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.290
that you've been unbelievable

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.270
at your craft for 30 years.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.470
Technology didn't care that
my dad's contemporaries

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.940
that came over from Russia
in 1978, moved to LA,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.910
made two bucks an hour being a cab driver,

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.160
worked 20 hours a day,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.010
saved every dollar for 13 years,

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.740
had paid their dues,
didn't see their family,

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:24.930
saved all their money,

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.460
bought a couple of black cars,

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.920
actually built a business,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.410
saved all their money, worked
every day for 30 years,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.240
finally getting to the moment

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.740
where eating all that shit
might pay off just a little bit,

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.053
and then Uber came along and
put them out of business.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.330
Technology didn't care
that your grandfather came

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:47.030
from Europe, worked 80 hours
a day for his whole life,

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.060
built a small little book store,

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:51.470
your dad came along, your mom came along,

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.650
made it bigger, now it was your turn,

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:54.900
and it's a real great place,

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.412
and you're gonna take it,

00:00:56.412 --> 00:00:57.245
and Amazon came along and
put you out of business.

00:00:57.245 --> 00:00:58.673
Technology doesn't care.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:01.640
I don't know what to tell you.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.850
This is called capitalism,

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.000
this is the way it works.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.740
And nobody's gonna cry for you,

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.160
and nobody's gonna cry for anybody.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:08.030
That's the point.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:10.040
And so of course that's happening.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.153
This always happens.

